WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.190
The book of Exodus tells of a people camped
at the foot of a mountain in the desert.

2
00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:09.310
There, it says, God made a
covenant with the whole people,

3
00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.420
not with one person alone.

4
00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:16.180
Its teaching is the Torah: five
books at the heart of the Tenakh.

5
00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:21.730
So is the Torah God's own words,
or human words inspired by God?

6
00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:25.050
In this mission, you'll open
the three parts of the Tenakh,

7
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:26.720
shelf by shelf.

8
00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:30.300
Then you'll read the promise
the people made in return.

9
00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:34.960
Your mission: find out whether Jews
see the Torah as God's own words,

10
00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:37.640
or as human words inspired by God.
